<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Primofin 1995 net loss 217.8 mln tolars.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Primofin 1995 net loss 217.8 mln tolars.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian financial consultancy Primofin reported on Friday a 1995 net loss of 217.8 million tolars ($1.7 million) on sales of 145.6 million tolars.</p>
<p>The company declined to give figures for 1994 and would not comment on its 1995 results. -- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439 ($ = 131.4 Slovenian Tolars)</p>
</text>
